    <string name="desc_exclusion_zones">Draw building / structure footprints and set their height AGL. Effectors may not engage through these volumes.</string>
    <string name="desc_sensors">Place radar, camera and EO/IR sensors with AGL, range, beam width and terrain-aware coverage.</string>
    <string name="desc_non_kinetic">Place RF effectors and render terrain-aware jamming effectiveness heat maps.</string>
    <string name="desc_kinetic">Place kinetic effectors; model fragmentation along the full munition path (3D cylinder) and compute minimum intercept altitude over exclusion zones.</string>
    <string name="desc_defended_assets">Outline the assets being defended and assign priorities.</string>
    <string name="desc_authority">Buffer perimeters offset from exclusion zones, defended assets or a drawn boundary: non-kinetic authority, kinetic authority and non-hostile (weapons hold) zones, with effector authority checks.</string>
    <string name="desc_threat_corridors">Define likely sUAS ingress corridors with width, speed and altitude.</string>
    <string name="desc_gap_analysis">Identify detection and engagement coverage gaps around defended assets and along corridors.</string>
    <string name="desc_timeline">Detect-to-defeat timeline and engagement sequence per corridor, with best-effector designation and friendly-fire deconfliction.</string>
    <string name="desc_msa">Minimum Safe Altitude / Minimum Safe Area calculations for every kinetic effector.</string>
    <string name="desc_pace">Primary / Alternate / Contingency / Emergency plan and decision-maker briefing export.</string>
    <string name="desc_settings">Units, precision, transparency and plan metadata.</string>

